BS4|BANDSCOPE SPAN|BS4P1;|BS4;|P1 0 5k; 1 10k; 2 25k; 3 50k; 4 100k; 5 200k; 6 500k; 9 initial (set only)
BS5|BANDSCOPE SCOPE RANGE (FIXED)|BS5P1;|BS5;|P1 0-3
BS6|BANDSCOPE DISPLAY PAUSE|BS6P1;|BS6;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
BS7|BANDSCOPE MARKER|BS7P1;|BS7;|P1 0 RX freq only; 1 RX and TX freq
BS8|BANDSCOPE ATTENUATOR|BS8P1;|BS8;|P1 0 OFF; 1 10dB; 2 20dB; 3 30dB
BS9|BANDSCOPE MAX HOLD|BS9P1;|BS9;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
BSA|BANDSCOPE AVERAGING|BSAP1;|BSA;|P1 0 OFF; 1-3 level
BSB|BANDSCOPE WATERFALL SPEED|BSBP1;|BSB;|P1 1-4
BSC|BANDSCOPE REFERENCE LEVEL|BSCP1P1P1;|BSC;|P1 000-060 (000=-20dB 040=0dB 060=+10dB, 0.5 dB steps)
