SP|SPLIT FREQUENCY SETTING|SPP1; or SPP1P2P3;|SP;|P1 0 complete; 1 start; 2 cancel (set only); P2 0 plus; 1 minus; P3 1-9 kHz
SQ|SQUELCH|SQP1P1P1;|SQ;|P1 000-255
SR|RESET|SRP1;||P1 2 memory ch reset; 3 VFO reset; 4 standard reset; 5 full reset
SS|PROGRAM SLOW SCAN POINT|SSP1P2P3(11);|SSP1P2;|P1 section; P2 spot; P3 Hz
SU|PROGRAM SCAN SECTION / MEMORY GROUP|SUP1P2...P13;|SUP1;|P1 0 program scan; 1 memory scan group; P2-P13 selected 0/1
SV|MEMORY TRANSFER|SV;||no parameter
TB|SPLIT|TBP1;|TB;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
TF1|TX FILTER LOW-CUT|TF1P1;|TF1;|P1 1 = 100 Hz; 4 = 400 Hz; 5 = 500 Hz (full table not legible)
TF2|TX FILTER HIGH-CUT|TF2P1;|TF2;|P1 (1 = 2600; 4 = 2900; 5 = 3000; 6 = 3500; 7 = 4000 Hz)
TI|TEMPORARY TX INHIBIT|TIP1;|TI;|P1 0 OFF; 1 inhibit; no AI answer
TM0|TIMER|TM0P1;|TM0;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
TM1|PROGRAM TIMER|TM1P1...P13;|TM1P1;|P1 1 on timer; 3 on/off; 4 record; P2-P8 days; times; frequency (see manual)
TM2|SLEEP TIMER|TM2P1P2P2P2;|TM2;|P1 0 OFF .. 7 120 min (2 10 min; 4 30 min; 6 90 min); P2 minutes
TN|FM TONE FREQUENCY|TNP1P1;|TN;|P1 01-42 (table in manual)
TO|TONE/CTCSS/CROSS TONE|TOP1;|TO;|P1 0 OFF; 1 tone; 2 CTCSS; 3 cross tone
TS|TF-SET|TSP1;|TS;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
TX|TRANSMIT|TXP1;||P1 0 SEND/PTT; 1 DATA SEND/PKS; 2 TX TUNE; no P1 = 0; answer TXP1; only when AI on
UD|VFO UP/DOWN|UDP1P2P3P3; or UDP1P2;||P1 0 VFO A; 1 VFO B; P2 0 up; 1 down; P3 00-99 steps
UR|RX EQUALIZER USER LEVELS|URP1P1...P18P18;|UR;|18 x 2 digit levels 00-30 (00=+6 dB 06=0 dB 30=-24 dB); 99 initial
UT|TX EQUALIZER USER LEVELS|UTP1P1...P18P18;|UT;|same as UR
UP|MIC UP|UPP1P1;||P1 00-99; none = 1 step
VD|VOX DELAY|VDP1P2P2P2;|VDP1;|P1 input 0 mic 1 ACC2 2 USB 3 LAN; P2 000-020 x 150 ms (lower bound partly illegible); 999 initial
VG0|VOX GAIN|VG0P1P2P2P2;|VG0P1;|P1 input 0 mic 1 ACC2 2 USB 3 LAN; P2 000-020; 999 initial
VG1|ANTI-VOX LEVEL|VG1P1P2P2P2;|VG1P1;|P1 input; P2 000-020; 999 initial
VR0|VOICE GUIDE|VR0P1;|VR0;|P1 2 Voice 2; 3 Voice 3 (0 and 1 not legible in extraction)
VR1|AUTO ANNOUNCE PAUSE|VR1P1;|VR1;|P1 1 pause (0 presumably off)
VV|VFO A=B|VV;||no parameter
VX|VOX|VXP1;|VX;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON; SSB/FM/AM only
XO|TRANSVERTER OFFSET|XOP1P2(11);|XO;|P1 0 plus; 1 minus; P2 Hz
XT|XIT|XTP1;|XT;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON; set only: XIT shift
XV|TRANSVERTER FUNCTION|XVP1;|XV;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
00|NOTIFICATION OF RESTART||(unsolicited)|"00;" output after reset/restart
##CN|LAN CONNECTION REQUEST|##CN;||Answer ##CNP1; 1 authorized; 0 denied
##DD2|BANDSCOPE DATA (LAN)||(LAN output)|1280 digits
##DD3|FILTER SCOPE DATA (LAN)||(LAN output)|
