##KN0|KNS OPERATION|##KN0P1;|##KN0;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON (LAN)
##KN1|ADMIN ID/PASSWORD|##KN1...;||see manual
##KN2|BUILT-IN VOIP|##KN2P1;|##KN2;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
##KN3|VOIP AUDIO LEVEL|##KN3P1P2P2P2;|##KN3P1;|P1 type 0 input 1 output; P2 000-100; 999 initial
##KN4|VOIP JITTER BUFFER|##KN4P1P1;|##KN4;|P1 x20 ms (10 = 200 ms; 40 = 800 ms); 99 initial
##KN5|SPEAKER MUTE REMOTE|##KN5P1;|##KN5;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
##KN6|KNS ACCESS LOG|##KN6P1;|##KN6;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
##KN7|REGISTERED USER REMOTE|##KN7P1;|##KN7;|P1 0 OFF; 1 ON
##KN8|KNS USER LIST COUNT||##KN8;|Answer ##KN8P1P1P1;
##KN9|REGISTER KNS USER|##KN9P1P1P1P2P2P3P3P4P5P6P7P8P9;||see manual
##KNA|EDIT KNS USER|##KNAP1P1P1...;|##KNAP1P1P1;|see manual
##KNB|DELETE KNS USER|##KNBP1P1P1;||
##KNC|KNS WELCOME MESSAGE|##KNCP1P2;|##KNC;|
##KND|KNS SESSION TIME|##KNDP1P1;|##KND;|P1 02 3 min; 04 10 min; 05 15 min; 06 20 min; 08 40 min; 10 60 min; 11 90 min
##KNE|CHANGE PASSWORD|##KNEP1;||answer ##KNEP2; 0 NG
##ST|ELAPSED SESSION TIME||(answer)|##STP1P1P2P2P3P3...
